00:01:58.950 --> 00:02:16.825
Every animal needs a home. Bees live in a hive, and ants build an anthill. A spider makes a web. A rabbit lives in a rabbit hole, and a fox sleeps in a den. Moles dig a burrow under the ground. Beavers build a lodge in the river. Horses sleep in a stable.

